        "node_id": "n_1_2a2c1e",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1: The current approach generates the entire string for each query, which is inefficient and leads to time limit exceeded errors. Instead, we should analyze the pattern of string growth to directly calculate the k-th character without generating the entire string. This requires understanding how the length of f_n changes with n and how the structure of the string is repeated.",
